OL,3,GNEWSAHackers steal data from millions
OL,4,Aof airport customers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree major UK airports have been hit
OL,7,Fby a "cyber security incident" in which
OL,8,Fcriminal cyber hackers accessed the
OL,9,Fdata of almost nine million people.
OL,11,FManchester Airports Group (MAG), which
OL,12,Fowns Manchester, East Midlands and
OL,13,FLondon Stansted airports, said
OL,14,Fcustomers' contact details, vehicle
OL,15,Fregistrations and postcodes were
OL,16,Fobtained by hackers at the weekend.
OL,18,FMAG said that "at no point has
OL,19,Fpassenger safety or aviation security
OL,20,Fbeen compromised" during the incident
OL,21,Fand the system hacked did not hold
OL,22,Fcustomers' bank or payment details.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
